                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b8fdf12-ccfb-41f2-8dfb-90320b41ea0a",
                                "sense_id": "5f16bb48-ef51-3746-9bb2-f30cb389e0ca",
                                "text": "This lethal fusion of economic insecurity and cultural scapegoating brought neoliberalism to its knees. […] The age of Obama was the last gasp of neoliberalism. Despite some progressive words and symbolic gestures, Obama chose to ignore Wall Street crimes, reject bailouts for homeowners, oversee growing inequality and facilitate war crimes like US drones killing innocent civilians abroad.",
                                "translation": "经济不安全感与文化替罪羊的致命结合，最终使新自由主义走向衰亡。 […] 奥巴马时代是新自由主义的最后挣扎。尽管奥巴马发表了一些进步言论，也做出了一些象征性的姿态，但他却选择对华尔街的罪行视而不见，拒绝为房主提供救助，放任日益加剧的不平等，并纵容诸如美国无人机在海外杀害无辜平民等战争罪行。"
                            }
